                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَكَّلَ عَلَيْهِ</span></b> 
                        , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عليه</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِتَّكَلَ</span></b> , <i>He relied
upon him;</i> (S, Msb;) <i>and confided in him:</i>
(Msb:) <i>he submitted himself to him.</i> (K.) ― 
